From the ideal gas equation

\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{PV}=\mathrm{n} \cdot \mathrm{R} T \\
& \frac{\mathrm{P}}{\mathrm{T}}=\frac{\mathrm{C}}{\mathrm{V}} \\
