\Rightarrow T_1 \cdot V_1^{\gamma-1}=T_2 V_2^{\gamma-1} \Rightarrow T_2=T_1\left(\frac{V_1}{V_2}\right)^{\gamma-1}

Here, $r=1.5, V_2=V_1 / 2$
